            "title": "全日收市｜港股收跌251點  聯想午後揚升   科指全周跌逾2%",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">港股收跌251點，午後跌幅收窄，生科股跑贏，聯想(00992)午後升幅擴大，汽車及相關股跑輸，成交僅千億元。一周計恒指跌近1%，科指逾2%。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"圖片來源：聯想官網影片截圖\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/11/bplib_20230705-135716_source-web_00992_source-web_-1.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：聯想官網影片截圖\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/11/bplib_20230705-135716_source-web_00992_source-web_-1.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">圖片來源：聯想官網影片截圖</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">恒生指數全日收報24,510點，跌251點或1.01%，今早開報24,523，跌237點或0.96%，上午見24,275，挫486點或1.96%，為全日低位，午後跌幅收窄，臨近收市見24,537，跌224點或0.9%，為全日高位。</p>\n<!-- slider begin -->\n<div class=\"fancy-slider\">\n<p class=\"fancy-gallery-tips\" style=\"font-weight: bold;font-size: 18px; margin: 0\">點擊看圖輯</p>\n<div class=\"fancy-main\">\n<div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<a class=\"fancy-main__slide\" data-caption=\"圖片來源：聯想官網影片截圖\" data-fancybox=\"slider-gallery\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/11/bplib_20230705-135716_source-web_00992_source-web_-1.jpg.webp\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__image\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：聯想官網影片截圖\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/11/bplib_20230705-135716_source-web_00992_source-web_-1.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-main__title bpcategory-special-color\">圖片來源：聯想官網影片截圖</h3>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<a class=\"fancy-main__slide\" data-caption=\"圖片來源：藥明康德官網\" data-fancybox=\"slider-gallery\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/20250403_FI_source-web_02359-3-2.jpg.webp\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__image\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：藥明康德官網\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/20250403_FI_source-web_02359-3-2.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-main__title bpcategory-special-color\">圖片來源：藥明康德官網</h3>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<a class=\"fancy-main__slide\" data-caption=\"圖片來源：濰柴動力官網\" data-fancybox=\"slider-gallery\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/20250409_FI_source-web_02338.jpg.webp\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__image\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：濰柴動力官網\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/20250409_FI_source-web_02338.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-main__title bpcategory-special-color\">圖片來源：濰柴動力官網</h3>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<a class=\"fancy-main__slide\" data-caption=\"AP圖片\" data-fancybox=\"slider-gallery\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/07/dd05dacc1c9af92cc32523b8285fe911_Alibaba_Pentagon_562_1.jpg.webp\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__image\">\n<img alt=\"AP圖片\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/644x392/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/07/dd05dacc1c9af92cc32523b8285fe911_Alibaba_Pentagon_562_1.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-main__title bpcategory-special-color\">AP圖片</h3>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fancy-main__controls\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__controls-text bpcategory-special-color\">更多相片</div>\n<div class=\"fancy-main__buttons\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__button __prev fancy-main-prev\" style=\"border-right: 8px solid #996600\"></div>\n<div class=\"rule\"></div>\n<div class=\"fancy-main__button __next fancy-main-next\" style=\"border-left: 8px solid #996600\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs\">\n<div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs__image\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：聯想官網影片截圖\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/11/bplib_20230705-135716_source-web_00992_source-web_-1.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-thumbs__title bpcategory-special-color\">圖片來源：聯想官網影片截圖</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs__image\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：藥明康德官網\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/20250403_FI_source-web_02359-3-2.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-thumbs__title bpcategory-special-color\">圖片來源：藥明康德官網</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs__image\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：濰柴動力官網\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/20250409_FI_source-web_02338.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-thumbs__title bpcategory-special-color\">圖片來源：濰柴動力官網</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<div class=\"fancy-thumbs__image\">\n<img alt=\"AP圖片\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/644x392/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/07/dd05dacc1c9af92cc32523b8285fe911_Alibaba_Pentagon_562_1.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-thumbs__title bpcategory-special-color\">AP圖片</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- slider end -->\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">恒生科技指數全日報4,311，跌49點或1.13%，今早開報4,318，跌42點或0.99% ;</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">恒生國企指數全日報8,165，跌100點或1.21%，今早開跌93點或1.13%，報8,172。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">大市成交1,022.03億元。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">恒指一周累跌240點或0.96% ; 科指累跌94點或2.13% ; 國指累跌60點或0.75%。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">期指轉高水，即月期指全日報24,527，跌164點或0.66%，高水17點  ; 科指期貨報4,317，跌34點或0.78%，高水5點 ; 國指期貨報8,170，跌73點或0.89%，高水4點。     </p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">美國長債息率升至22年高，科網、晶片及內房沽壓大。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">聯想集團(00992)午後升幅擴大，並以全日高位收市，升3.16%，報37.16元，為表現最佳藍籌股。中金報告成為股價午後催化劑。報告指，聯想在9月中的投資人交流會後，明確了長期盈利能力提升路徑。隨着超節點商業化加快，聯想在人工智能基礎設施的競爭正由單機伺服器延伸至系統級能力。維持聯想「跑贏行業」評級及51港元目標價。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"圖片來源：藥明康德官網\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/20250403_FI_source-web_02359-3-2.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：藥明康德官網\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/20250403_FI_source-web_02359-3-2.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">圖片來源：藥明康德官網</p>\n</a>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">生科醫藥股午後續跑贏，藥明康德(02359)升2.24%，報209.6元，升幅藍籌股中居第二位 ; 藥明生物(02269)升2.12%，報53元，升幅居第三位 ; 百濟神州(06060)升0.56%，報216.4元。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"圖片來源：濰柴動力官網\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/20250409_FI_source-web_02338.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：濰柴動力官網\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/20250409_FI_source-web_02338.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">圖片來源：濰柴動力官網</p>\n</a>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">汽車股跑輸，汽車零部件相關股濰柴動力(02338)挫4.78%，報27.94元，為表現最差藍籌股。理想汽車(02015)跌3.25%，報45.24元 ; 小米集團(01810)跌2.56%，報25.9元 ; 比亞迪股份(01211)跌1.76%，報78.1元 ; 小鵬(09868)跌1.89%，報39.46元。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">阿里巴巴(09988)跌1.46%，報108.4元，影響恒指49點; 友邦保險(01299)跌2.7%，報73.75元，影響恒指39點。</p>\n\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"AP圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/07/dd05dacc1c9af92cc32523b8285fe911_Alibaba_Pentagon_562_1.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"AP圖片\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/07/dd05dacc1c9af92cc32523b8285fe911_Alibaba_Pentagon_562_1.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">AP圖片</p>\n</a>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/16845826-%e5%85%a8%e6%97%a5%e6%94%b6%e5%b8%82%ef%bd%9c%e6%b8%af%e8%82%a1%e6%94%b6%e8%b7%8c251%e9%bb%9e-%e8%81%af%e6%83%b3%e5%8d%88%e5%be%8c%e6%8f%9a%e5%8d%87-%e7%a7%91%e6%8c%87%e5%85%a8%e5%91%a8%e8%b7%8c",
